# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored; never commit a real token.
#
# A Hugging Face access token. Needed for the gated models in the registry
# (Llama-3.1, Gemma-2, Airavata, IndicTrans2, Bodhan Indic-OCR) and also
# raises rate limits and download speed for the open ones.
#
# Create one at https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens (read scope is enough),
# and accept each gated model's licence on its model page.
HF_TOKEN=
